{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>In a moment they die</b> — at midnight, at the time of rest." "<b>They are shaken</b> — they will quake, like <b>and they were shaken</b> (ותתגעש), for he was angry." "<b>And they pass away</b> — and they die, in the sense of: <b>He passes on, he goes his way</b>, for what is born comes and the dead goes and passes away." "<b>And they are removed</b> — and the mighty die." "<b>Not by hand</b> — not by strength and not by might."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 34, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:29.263345040Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}